{"seq":7,"slug":"mao-poetry","title":"毛泽东诗词研究","stage":"DONE","category":"mao-zedong-studies","categoryLabel":"毛泽东研究","chapterCount":3,"docCount":8,"url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-poetry","rating":{"composite":3.5,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":3.67,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/01_mao-zedong-studies/07_mao-poetry","introMarkdown":"# 毛泽东诗词研究 简介\n\n毛泽东不仅是伟大的革命家和理论家，也是二十世纪中国最具影响力的诗人之一。他以旧体诗词的传统形式承载革命理想与时代精神，创作了大量气势磅礴、意境深远的诗词作品。这些作品既是中国古典文学传统的当代延续，也是革命浪漫主义与现实主义相结合的艺术典范，在中国文学史上占有独特而重要的地位。\n\n本知识库适用于希望系统研究毛泽东诗词艺术成就与思想内涵的读者，无论是文学研究者、诗词爱好者，还是对毛泽东思想的文学表达感兴趣的一般读者，都能从中获得兼顾艺术欣赏与思想解读的深入认知。\n\n第一章**诗词概论与艺术特色**，从毛泽东诗词创作的整体面貌与分期出发，分析其以旧体形式表达革命新意的艺术创新手法，并系统梳理其诗词中反复出现的核心意象群与独特的修辞艺术。\n\n第二章**代表性诗词精读**，按创作时间脉络选取各时期最具代表性的作品进行细致解读，涵盖早期井冈山时期的革命豪情、长征延安时期的史诗气魄、以及建国后的宏阔视野与哲理沉思。\n\n第三章**思想内涵与文化价值**，从哲学智慧与政治理念两个维度解析诗词背后的思想深度，并从文学史定位和文化遗产传承的角度评价毛泽东诗词的持久影响与当代价值。\n\n推荐学习路径为：先通过第一章建立对毛泽东诗词创作全貌的整体认知，把握其艺术风格的独特性；再在第二章中通过具体作品的精读感受诗词的艺术魅力与情感力量；最后在第三章中从思想与文化的高度完成对毛泽东诗词价值的全面评价。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"overview-artistic-features","title":"诗词概论与艺术特色","docCount":3,"url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-poetry/overview-artistic-features","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"poetry-overview-periodization","title":"毛泽东诗词创作概览与分期","url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-poetry/overview-artistic-features/poetry-overview-periodization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"classical-form-revolutionary-content","title":"旧体新用：古典形式与革命内容","url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-poetry/overview-artistic-features/classical-form-revolutionary-content"},{"seq":3,"slug":"imagery-system-rhetoric","title":"意象体系与修辞艺术","url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-poetry/overview-artistic-features/imagery-system-rhetoric"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"representative-works","title":"代表性诗词精读","docCount":3,"url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-poetry/representative-works","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-jinggangshan-masterpieces","title":"早期与井冈山时期代表作","url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-poetry/representative-works/early-jinggangshan-masterpieces"},{"seq":2,"slug":"long-march-yanan-masterpieces","title":"长征与延安时期代表作","url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-poetry/representative-works/long-march-yanan-masterpieces"},{"seq":3,"slug":"post-1949-masterpieces","title":"建国后代表作","url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-poetry/representative-works/post-1949-masterpieces"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"thought-cultural-value","title":"思想内涵与文化价值","docCount":2,"url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-poetry/thought-cultural-value","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"philosophy-politics-in-poetry","title":"诗词中的哲学思想与政治智慧","url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-poetry/thought-cultural-value/philosophy-politics-in-poetry"},{"seq":2,"slug":"literary-status-cultural-heritage","title":"诗词的文学地位与文化遗产","url":"/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/mao-poetry/thought-cultural-value/literary-status-cultural-heritage"}]}]}